completed_at: "2026-07-31T10:11:15.541Z"
claim_principal: "harness:codex"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: A failing run under the default format emits toon through the host renderer; a failing run under json emits json; a failing run under markdown emits markdown; the exit code is non-zero in every case
parent: ops-073p
resolution: Centralized format serialization and emitted the selected format before throwing the expected failure.
expected_result: Every failing output format remains parseable and the command preserves a non-zero exit.
actual_result: "TOON, JSON, and Markdown now share one serializer; real installed-CLI tests decode default TOON and JSON while observing exit 1."
